          "Kai"
        ],
        "row_id": "sb_001"
      },
      {
        "action": "Embry's phone buzzes from the beach bag as sweat and salt mark her face. Her palm skids on sun-softened wax, forcing her to reset her rail grip before the wave reaches the reef line.",
        "required_entities": [
          "Embry",
          "Kai"
        ],
        "row_id": "sb_002"
      },
      {
        "action": "Kai reads the local, the channel, the reef, and Embry's paddle cadence. He holds position instead of taking the easy wave, then gives one restrained cue.",
        "required_entities": [
          "Embry",
          "Kai"
        ],
        "row_id": "sb_003"
      },
      {
        "action": "Embry chooses the safe channel and commits only when the lineup opens. The wave, reef, softened wax, and phone obligation converge into one visible decision.",
